{
 "brief": "Egypt, Qatar, and Turkey issued a strong condemnation of recent Israeli attacks on Gaza, according to Shehab Wire. The three countries, acting as mediators in the conflict, expressed grave concern over the strikes, which resulted in civilian casualties including women and children. They emphasized their deep alarm at the continuation of what they characterized as violations in the territory.\n\nThe three nations reiterated calls for strict adherence to ceasefire commitments. As mediating powers involved in negotiations between the parties, Egypt, Qatar, and Turkey stressed the importance of maintaining agreed-upon terms and halting military operations in Gaza.",
